1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:03,579
(Leonard:)Um, I don't really know
how to say this.

2
00:00:03,582 --> 00:00:05,252
(Colonel Williams:)Well, you could try
starting with "sir".

3
00:00:05,251 --> 00:00:07,251
(Leonard:)Right. Sorry, sir.

4
00:00:07,253 --> 00:00:09,923
(Sheldon:)He said start with it,
not end with it.

5
00:00:11,524 --> 00:00:12,994
(Colonel Williams:)- Sir...
- Hmm?

6
00:00:12,995 --> 00:00:14,695
(Howard:)We've hit a bit
of a snag.

7
00:00:14,696 --> 00:00:16,626
(Howard:)We're already behind schedule.

8
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:19,803
(Sheldon:)The computations required
to overcome

9
00:00:19,801 --> 00:00:21,201
(Sheldon:)the deployability issues

10
00:00:21,203 --> 00:00:23,533
(Sheldon:)are more significant
than we thought.

11
00:00:23,539 --> 00:00:25,569
(Leonard:)I understand that
we're under contract,

12
00:00:25,574 --> 00:00:27,174
(Leonard:)and I don't know what
the consequences

13
00:00:27,176 --> 00:00:29,246
(Leonard:)of violating that are,
but, uh...

14
00:00:29,244 --> 00:00:31,744
(Leonard:)we're not gonna
be able to deliver

15
00:00:31,747 --> 00:00:33,317
(Leonard:)in the time we promised.

16
00:00:40,022 --> 00:00:41,722
(Colonel Williams:)How long do you need?

17
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:46,925
We-We're thinking...
two years.

18
00:00:49,698 --> 00:00:50,898
(The Flash:)All right.

19
00:00:52,434 --> 00:00:54,004
(Howard:)That's it?

20
00:00:54,002 --> 00:00:55,402
(Howard:)You're okay with that?

21
00:00:55,404 --> 00:00:57,874
(Bernadette:)You think you're
the first government contractor

22
00:00:57,873 --> 00:01:00,103
(Colonel Williams:)who isn't gonna deliver
on time?

23
00:01:00,108 --> 00:01:01,778
(Colonel Williams:)We're still waiting
for a big space laser

24
00:01:01,777 --> 00:01:04,577
(Colonel Williams:)Reagan ordered
to beat the commies.

25
00:01:06,215 --> 00:01:07,645
(Leonard:)Thanks for understanding,
sir.

26
00:01:07,649 --> 00:01:09,349
(Howard:)Yes, thank you
so much.

27
00:01:09,351 --> 00:01:11,621
We-We really
appreciate it.

28
00:01:13,021 --> 00:01:14,051
(The Flash:)All right,
pressure's off

29
00:01:14,056 --> 00:01:15,226
(Howard(off):)Wanna see a movie?

30
00:01:15,224 --> 00:01:46,494
(Sheldon(off):)Popcorn's on me.

